    "detailed_description": "DESTROY cities with your bare hands! Burn buildings! Toss tanks! Grab \u2013 and eat \u2013 people! Block Buster is dedicated to every Kaiju movie you\u2019ve ever watched.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTEAR up the town with FIVE unique playable monsters: A giant ape, a radioactive lizard, a massive mecha, an angry prawn\u2026or\u2026a\u2026badass butterfly\u2026? Just go with it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRAMPAGE through destruction-based scavenger hunts in five unique cities as you battle bosses and unlock hidden paths.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd when the smashing's done, go and build custom cosplay beasts in your ultimate Kaiju fan lair.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou like bullet points? So do we!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00b7 5 unique, playable monsters!<br />\r\n\u00b7 5 fully destructible cities to demolish!<br />\r\n\u00b7 Hidden items and secret paths throughout each level!<br />\r\n\u00b7 Over 200 collectible items and prizes for players to win!<br />\r\n\u00b7 Build your beast with avatar and monster customization!<br />\r\n\u00b7 Weapons and human interactions!<br />\r\n\u00b7 Awesome soundtrack by 8-bit Weapon and ComputeHer!<br />\r\n\u00b7 BULLET POINTS!",
